          "-",
          "-                <div class=\"item\">",
          "-                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/\" target=\"_blank\">The Definition of 'Slop' in AI Content</a></div>",
          "-                    <div class=\"meta-row\">",
          "-                        <span class=\"type-badge type-opinion\">Opinion</span>",
          "-                        <span class=\"source\">Neurotica</span>",
          "-                    </div>",
          "-                    <div class=\"item-description\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; font-size: 9pt;\">Slop is defined as something that takes more human effort to consume than it took to produce. When a coworker sends raw AI output without review, they're disrespecting the recipient's time.</div>",
          "-                    <div class=\"topics\">",
          "-                        <span class=\"topic-tag\">ai-ethics</span>",
          "-                        <span class=\"topic-tag\">generative-ai</span>",
          "-                        <span class=\"topic-tag\">slop</span>",
          "-                    </div>",
          "-                </div>",
          "-",
          "-                <div class=\"item\">",
          "-                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/\" target=\"_blank\">The Real Work of Software Development</a></div>",
          "-                    <div class=\"meta-row\">",
          "-                        <span class=\"type-badge type-opinion\">Opinion</span>",
          "-                        <span class=\"source\">David Abram</span>",
          "-                    </div>",
          "-                    <div class=\"item-description\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; font-size: 9pt;\">The hardest parts of software development were never about typing code—understanding systems, debugging incomprehensible things, designing architectures that won't collapse.</div>",
          "-                    <div class=\"topics\">",
          "-                        <span class=\"topic-tag\">careers</span>",
          "-                        <span class=\"topic-tag\">ai</span>",
          "-                        <span class=\"topic-tag\">generative-ai</span>",
          "-                    </div>",
          "-                </div>",
          "-",
          "-                <div class=\"item\">",
          "-                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Mar/20/turbo-pascal/\" target=\"_blank\">Turbo Pascal 3.02A Deconstructed</a></div>",
          "-                    <div class=\"meta-row\">",
          "-                        <span class=\"type-badge type-technical\">Technical</span>",
