          "-                    </div>",
          "-                    <div class=\"item-description\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; font-size: 9pt;\">Simon used Claude to decompile Turbo Pascal 3.02A and create an annotated artifact. However, a reviewer found the assembly annotations were 'hallucinated slop'.</div>",
          "-                    <div class=\"topics\">",
